{"license":"DANS Licence","fileAccessRequest":false,"metadataBlocks":{"citation":{"displayName":"Citation Metadata","name":"citation","fields":[{"typeName":"title","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Getuigen Verhalen, Akkers van Margraten, Verenigde Staten, interview 39"},{"typeName":"otherId","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"otherIdAgency":{"typeName":"otherIdAgency","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"DANS-KNAW"},"otherIdValue":{"typeName":"otherIdValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"easy-dataset:41837"}}]},{"typeName":"author","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Ruim Kader Films"}},{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Regionaal Historisch Centrum Limburg ©"}}]},{"typeName":"datasetContact","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"datasetContactName":{"typeName":"datasetContactName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"EJ  Jansen"}}]},{"typeName":"dsDescription","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"dsDescriptionValue":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"<p>Geïnterviewde is de tweede zoon van een Amerikaanse soldaat en een bakkersdochter uit Maastricht. Na de oorlog vertrok de moeder van de geïnterviewde op een schip vol oorlogsbruiden naar de VS, waar ze het niet lang uithield. Ze ging terug. Haar man reisde haar achterna en vond werk op de Amerikaanse begraafplaats in Margraten, die op dat moment werd heringericht. Er werden voor die tijd zeer moderne woningen op de begraafplaats gebouwd voor de superintendent en de assistent superintendant. Geïnterviewde heeft tot zijn vierde levensjaar op de begraafplaats gewoond.<\/p>"}},{"dsDescriptionValue":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Date Submitted: 2010-05-29"}},{"dsDescriptionValue":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"<p>interview in het Engels | GEEN transcriptie, alleen aantekeningen en steekwoorden in het Engels| beschrijving in het Nederlands |<br>overeenkomsten met interviewers geplaatst in dataset GV_AvM_Margraten_01<\/p>"}}]},{"typeName":"subject","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Arts and Humanities"]},{"typeName":"keyword","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Amerikaanse begraafplaats Margraten"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Oral history"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"landing in Normandië"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"oorlogsbruiden (war brides)"}}]},{"typeName":"language","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["English"]},{"typeName":"productionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2010-05-29"},{"typeName":"contributor","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"contributorName":{"typeName":"contributorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"research &amp; interview: Jo Purnot (SHOM)"}},{"contributorName":{"typeName":"contributorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"research: Frans Roebroeks (RHCL)"}},{"contributorName":{"typeName":"contributorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"research, interview &amp; geluid: Albert Elings (Ruim Kader Films)"}},{"contributorName":{"typeName":"contributorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"research, interview &amp; camera: Eugenie Jansen (Ruim Kader Films)"}},{"contributorName":{"typeName":"contributorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"interview: Mieke Kirkels (SHOM)"}}]},{"typeName"